<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Food Price Index rises 0.6 pct in Jan.</title>
<headline>NZ Food Price Index rises 0.6 pct in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Friday released the following data for the Food Price Index for January:</p>
<p>    Jan 1997	    Dec 1996		 Jan 1996</p>
<p>   +0.6 pct	     -0.7 pct		 -0.2 pct</p>
<p>yr-end Jan 1997  yr-end Dec 1996  yr-end Jan 1996</p>
<p>   +2.4 pct	     +1.7 pct		 +0.3 pct</p>
<p>Note - The index makes up 18 percent of the consumer price index (CPI).  </p>
<p>Food subgroups, percentage change from the same month of the previous year:</p>
<p>				    Jan 1997	Dec 1996</p>
<p>    Fruit and Vegetables    -0.4 pct	-4.2 pct</p>
<p>    Meat, fish and poultry  +3.0 pct	+0.1 pct</p>
<p>    Grocery food etc	  +3.2 pct	+3.5 pct</p>
<p>    Restaurants		 +2.0 pct	+2.0 pct</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
